  "observer": "xmapedit-observe draws one static state and reads no XSPRITE (obs_main.c:369), so a switch's state picture is posed by picnum",
  "not_modelled": [
    "whether a sender's state actually changes: SetSpriteState returns before sending when it does not (triggers.cpp:87-88), and the pose shows what the listeners do IF the message arrives. (A thing saved at state 0 does change: `actInit` sets every thing but a few to state 1 at level start, actor.cpp:2551, so its destruction is a real 1 -> 0.) A silent sender's listeners are not posed; a trigger_on/trigger_off gate the new state misses is flagged per listener (triggers.cpp:100-106)",
    "wait_time: a listener that returns on its own is shown at the far end of its travel, before it returns",
    "busy waves and the moment in between: only the two ends are posed"
